anicum </italic>L. Plumbaginaceae</td><td align="left">Amira</td><td align="left">coughing, 'kurtimat', cancer, swelling</td><td align="left">40%</td></tr><tr><td align="left"><italic>Dorstenia barnimiana </italic>Schweinf. Moraceae</td><td align="left">Work Bemeda</td><td align="left">cancer, rabies, syphilis, 'wef beshita', 'yeahya kintarot', 'mushuro'</td><td align="left">22%</td></tr></tbody></table></table-wrap></sec></back></article>